    "description": {
      "value": "**Trigger:** A creature within range takes damage from a slashing or piercing attack, or one that inflicts persistent bleed damage.\n\nYou spit a glob of caustic saltwater that stings the wounds of the creature. Make a ranged spell attack against the triggering creature's AC. On a hit, salt scours its open wound, dealing 2d6 persistent acid damage."
    },
